  "title": "ATEC Mourns Passing of Board Member Jeffrey P. Rydin",
  "summary": "Alphatec Holdings, Inc. (Nasdaq: ATEC) (“ATEC”), a provider of innovative solutions dedicated to revolutionizing the approach to spine surgery, today announced with great sadness that Jeffrey P. Rydin, a valued member of its Board of Directors, has passed away at age 59, following a lengthy illness. Mr. Rydin enjoyed nearly three decades of experience in the medical device and healthcare industries, including senior sales leadership roles at Ellipse Technologies, Inc., NuVasive, Inc., and DePuy",
